target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a Quote</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module dipi_button_grid_child dipi_button_grid_child_1 video_popup\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module_inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"et_pb_button dipi-button-grid dipi-button-wrap\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O67In8Hkyxc\" data-icon=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Watch Our Video</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_1 et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_1  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_divider et_pb_divider_0 et_pb_divider_position_ et_pb_space\"><div class=\"et_pb_divider_internal\"></div></div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h2>Meet our global team</h2></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_2 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters2\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3  et_pb_text_align_center et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>BeTranslated operates across the UK and Europe, offering you extensive time zone coverage and local access to professionals situated nearby. Our global operations extend our working hours, and your translations are managed by locals who are fluent in the language and are familiar with the culture. Successful translation relies significantly on resonating with your target market, and having a local presence brings you one step closer to achieving this.</p>\n<p>Below, you’ll find the names and addresses of our wider BeTranslated team. Please don’t hesitate to get in touch with your local office for any translation project, no matter how big or small. We will respond as soon as we can.</p>\n<p>If you reside in one of the countries listed below, or are aiming to connect with an audience in those locations, please feel free to contact your local account manager directly. For general inquiries about our services in <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.fr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">France</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.be/fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Belgium</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.es/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/\">the UK</a>, or any other country not listed here, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@betranslated.co.uk\">info@betranslated.com</a>. If you’d like us to provide a precise quote for your documents, kindly use our <a href=\"https://betranslated.com/translation-quote/?utm_source=betranslated-couk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">quote request form</a>.</p>\n<p>If you’re an experienced freelance translator interested in joining our team, please send us your CV <a href=\"mailto:cv@betranslated.com\">here</a>.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_row et_pb_row_3 et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters2\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_blurb_position_top_tablet et_pb_blurb_position_top_phone\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap\"><picture fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone wp-image-22992156\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/mike.jpg.webp 300w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/mike-150x150.jpg.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\">\n<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/mike.jpg\" alt=\"mike\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/mike.jpg 300w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/mike-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\">\n</picture>\n</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"et_pb_module_header\"><span>Michael Bastin</span></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_description\"><h5>Founder, CEO</h5>\n<p>As the founder of BeTranslated, Michael is responsible for the marketing, customer relations, and management of the brand’s websites, as well as proofreading and translation project management for various European and international clients. Born in Belgium, he spent many years in Latin America, and now lives in Valencia, Spain. French is his native language, but he is also fluent in English and Spanish, and has good knowledge of Dutch and German too.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_4  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1  et_pb_text_align_left  et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_blurb_position_top_tablet et_pb_blurb_position_top_phone\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap\"><picture decoding=\"async\" class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone wp-image-22992157\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/jf.jpg.webp 300w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/jf-150x150.jpg.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/jf.jpg\" alt=\"jf\" srcset=\"https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/jf.jpg 300w, https://www.betranslated.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/jf-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\">\n</picture>\n</span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"et_pb_module_header\"><span>Jean-François</span></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_description\"><h5>Co-owner, VP of sales</h5>\n<p>Jean-François manages translation projects in Wallonia, the French-speaking region of southern Belgium. He particularly enjoys, and is especially knowledgable about marketing, pedagogy, development cooperation, and sports, among many other fields.<br>Jean-François’ customers use the services of BeTranslated Belgium on a regular basis, and appreciate his reliability and professionalism.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et_section_re