t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module dipi_timeline_item dipi_timeline_item_4\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module_inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"dipi_timeline_item_custom_classes dipi_timeline_item_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_ dipi_timeline_item_custom-card-arrow \" data-config=\"{&quot;anim_name&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;anim_start_viewport&quot;:&quot;75%&quot;} \">\n        <div class=\"dipi_timeline_item_container\">\n          <div class=\"dipi_timeline_ribbon\"><span class=\"dipi_timeline_ribbon_text\">Follow-up &amp; Invoicing</span></div>\n          <div class=\"et_pb_image_wrap ribbon-icon-wrap\"><span class=\"et_pb_icon_wrap\"><span class=\"ribbon-icon ribbon-icon-circle\"></span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"dipi_timeline_item_card-wrap  need_animation \">\n            <div class=\"dipi_timeline_item_card\">\n              \n              <div class=\"dipi_timeline_item_content\">\n                <div class=\"dipi_timeline_ribbon\"><span class=\"dipi_timeline_ribbon_text\">Follow-up &amp; Invoicing</span></div>\n                <div class=\"dipi_timeline_item_content_text\">\n                  \n                  <div class=\"dipi_timeline_item_description\"><p>Once you are satisfied with your translation, we will send you your invoice.</p></div>\n                </div>\n                \n              </div> <!-- .dipi_timeline_item_content -->\n            </div> <!-- .dipi_timeline_item_card -->\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div></div>\n          <div class=\"dipi-timeline-line\"></div><div class=\"dipi-timeline-line__active\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t",
  "bodyText": "BeTranslated\n\nTranslation agency\n\nLocations\nOur Locations\nA small translation agency with an extensive professional network\nGet a Quote\nWatch Our Video\nMeet our global team\nBeTranslated operates across the UK and Europe, offering you extensive time zone coverage and local access to professionals situated nearby. Our global operations extend our working hours, and your translations are managed by locals who are fluent in the language and are familiar with the culture. Successful translation relies significantly on resonating with your target market, and having a local presence brings you one step closer to achieving this.\nBelow, you’ll find the names and addresses of our wider BeTranslated team. Please don’t hesitate to get in touch with your local office for any translation project, no matter how big or small. We will respond as soon as we can.\nIf you reside in one of the countries listed below, or are aiming to connect with an audience in those locations, please feel free to contact your local account manager directly. For general inquiries about our services in France, Belgium, Spain, the UK, or any other country not listed here, please email us at info@betranslated.com. If you’d like us to provide a precise quote for your documents, kindly use our quote request form.\nIf you’re an experienced freelance translator interested in joining our team, please send us your CV here.\nMichael Bastin\nFounder, CEO\nAs the founder of BeTranslated, Michael is responsible for the marketing, customer relations, and management of the brand’s websites, as well as proofreading and translation project management for various European and international clients. Born in Belgium, he spent many years in Latin America, and now lives in Valencia, Spain. French is his native language, but he is also fluent in English and Spanish, and has good knowledge of Dutch and German too.\nJean-François\nCo-owner, VP of sales\nJean-François manages translation projects in Wallonia, the French-speaking region of southern Belgium. He particularly enjoys, and is especially knowledgable about marketing, pedagogy, development cooperation, and sports, among many other fields.\nJean-François’ customers use the services of BeTranslated Belgium on a regular basis, and appreciate his reliability and professionalism.\nOur Offices\nA worldwide agency transcending borders\n\nSpain\nCalle Dr. Ferran 13\n46021 Valencia\nSpain\nes@betranslated.com\n(+34) 962 02 22 22\nContact Us\n\nBelgium\nRue de la Mutualité 106\n4030 Liège\nBelgium\ninfo@betranslated.be\n(+32) 477 28 42 55\nContact Us\n\nFrance\nAvenue Jean Moulin, 472,\n84320 Entraigues-sur-la-Sorgue\nFrance\ninfo@betranslated.fr\n+(33) 06 20 68 52 66\nContact Us\n\nUnited Kingdom\nInternational House\n24 Holborn Viaduct\nLondon EC1A 2BN, UK\nglobal@betranslated.com\n(+44) 20 3026 9848\nContact Us\nCONTACT US\nContact us for a free, no-obligation quote.\n\nCall us at\n+44 20 3026 9848\n\nEmail\nglobal@betranslated.com\n\nOffice Address\nInternational House, 24 Holborn Viaduct, London EC1A 2BN, UK\nGet a Quote\nAbout Us\nWhat Happens Next?\nRequest a Quote\n\nRequest a Quote\nOne of our regional managers will receive your request for a translation quote.\nReply\n\nReply\nA member of BeTranslated will respond to you within a couple of hours.\nAssessing Your Project\n\nAssessing Your Project\nWe match your project to the translator who best meets your needs according to the details of your request.\nDelivery\n\nDelivery\nYou will receive the translated files within the agreed-upon deadline.\nFollow-up & Invoicing\n\nFollow-up & Invoicing\nOnce you are satisfied with your translation, we will send you your invoice.",
